{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T15:56:23+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-22T15:56:23+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"ACEA S.p.A.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Diversified","country":"Italy","city":"Rome","website":"https://www.gruppoacea.it","employees":8886,"summary":"ACEA S.p.A., together with its subsidiaries, operates as a multi-utility company in Italy. The company operates through Environment, Commercial, Water, Water (Overseas), Production, Engineering & Infrastructure Projects, and Network & Public Lighting segments. It is involved in the waste management, power generation, water management, energy distribution and production, gas distribution, management of engineering services, and sale of electricity and natural gas, as well as supplies value added environmental services. The company also generates electricity through hydro, thermal, and photovoltaic sources. In addition, it provides sludge management, treatment, recycling; waste-to-energy and waste disposal management of recyclable plastics; water services; laboratory analysis, and engineering and consultancy services; public lighting; energy management; and design, construction, and management of integrated water systems. ACEA S.p.A. was founded in 1909 and is headquartered in Rome, Italy.","exchange":"Milan","currency":"EUR","financial_currency":"EUR","summary_fr":"ACEA S.p.A., avec ses filiales, opère en tant que société multi-services en Italie. La société opère à travers les secteurs de l'environnement, du commerce, de l'eau, de l'eau (outre-mer), de la production, de l'ingénierie et des projets d'infrastructure, ainsi que des réseaux et de l'éclairage public. Elle intervient dans la gestion des déchets, la production d’électricité, la gestion de l’eau, la distribution et la production d’énergie, la distribution de gaz, la gestion des services d’ingénierie et la vente d’élec